  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "CMake: Require explicit installation of development headers",
  "description": "Develpment headers are a sizeable part of the binary installation\nand most users won't ever require them. Maintainers should package\nthem separately in a devel package or SDK (or not, this change\ndoesn't restrict installation policies in any way, it just adds\nsome flexibility and changes the default).\n\nCreate a CMake installation component for development headers\nand add the EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL property.\n\nHeaders can be installed using the invocation:\n    cmake --install <dir> --component Development",
